# Database snapshots. They belong outside the repo — a dump is a copy of
# production user data, it goes stale the moment it is written, and a repo is
# the wrong place to keep either. Two were committed before this rule (both
# happened to be schema-only, no rows), which is exactly how the habit starts.
*.sql
